Third-party components
----------------------

None. Attention has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on 26/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used for the week export

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

What this app does not do
-------------------------

It does not block sites or apps, does not send notifications, and does not score, grade or rate a day.
There is no score field, no blocklist and no streak in the engine. It records sessions and interruptions
and reports where the drift was by hour of the day; the judging is the reader's.
